  "releaseNotes": "Maintenance: the build has no warnings and treats new ones as errors; SourceLink updated (the previous build-time dependency had a moderate advisory). Kafka: KafkaStepResultExtensions.JsonPath, which the instance method KafkaStepResult.JsonPath always took precedence over, is obsolete and removed in 7.0; it now gives the same result. No code changes needed from 6.10.0. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
